name the mechanism. a figure may follow it; it may not replace it.

"the refusal reaches the control" is a picture. "the error is displayed
on the field that failed" is what happens, and it is not longer.

the aphorism is the same fault better dressed — "one response, two
audiences", "a name, not a seam". it is memorable because it is
compressed, and the mechanism is what the compression spent.

the test: can the reader act on it? a sentence nobody can act on was
decoration, however true it is.

headings take this hardest, being read first and alone.
`general/naming/domain` is this rule pointed at names.
